pliron-linalg

Original Rust implementation: Apache License 2.0 (LICENSE).

Operation definitions, semantics, documentation, and named-operation metadata
are adapted from the LLVM Project's MLIR Linalg dialect, including
LinalgNamedStructuredOps.yaml, at revision
f1ee8b38f40fd1f0e9596197b8e690eb9b57ec0c.
Copyright The LLVM Project Contributors.
Upstream license: Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions (LICENSE-LLVM).
https://github.com/llvm/llvm-project/tree/f1ee8b38f40fd1f0e9596197b8e690eb9b57ec0c/mlir/include/mlir/Dialect/Linalg

Modifications: tensor-only native pliron operations, Rust region builders and
diagnostics, verification helpers, generated named-operation specifications,
and generic/custom MLIR textual export. Named operations reconstruct their
implicit scalar regions in the upstream MLIR parser.
